5,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep this organized. I suggest we focus on contradictions in our statements to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful plan, Minako dear. I hope we can all get along while we solve this.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. I'll be observing everyone's logical consistency. If someone's story shifts, they'll be my primary suspect.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A rational approach is best. I shall contribute any factual observations I make to help the village.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"This is exciting! I'll just be honest and help everyone. Why are we already talking about suspects, though?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"We aren't naming suspects yet, Kenji. We are just establishing how we will identify the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It's a bit scary, isn't it? But I trust you all to be fair.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, your eagerness is noted. Just stay consistent with your claims as the game progresses.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A baseline of behavior now will make it easier to spot anomalies tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I will! I'm just curious. @Benjamin, you seem very confident. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,Let's not reveal roles too early. It gives the werewolf an advantage if they know who to target.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Minako is right. Let's keep a little mystery for now, shall we?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I concur. Revealing the Seer prematurely is a tactical error.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,A fair point. I shall keep my thoughts to myself for the moment to ensure the village's safety.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Aw, okay. I just wanted to know who to trust!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Trust should be earned through evidence, not guesses. I'm ready for the first night.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,I'll be praying for everyone's safety tonight.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I've noted everyone's initial tone. I'm ready.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic shall be our guide. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight! I hope nothing bad happens!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
