31,1,1,talk,Minako,,We are all here. Does anyone have information or observations to share before we begin the discussion?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I slept quite soundly, though I worry about who might be hiding a secret.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, you were very composed yesterday. Do you have any insights from the night?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I do. I have confirmed that Shizue is the werewolf.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,What?! Shizue? No way! She's way too nice to be a werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"That is a very direct claim. @Benjamin, are you claiming the Seer role openly now?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my... Benjamin, how could you say such a thing? I'm just a grandmother.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"The timing is efficient. If Benjamin is the Seer, the game ends today. If he's lying, he's the werewolf or possessed.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I am the Seer. I believe in transparency when the evidence is this clear.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I think Benjamin is trying to trick us! Why would he just say it so fast? It feels suspicious!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, your immediate defense of Shizue is interesting. Why are you so certain?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'm so saddened that there is such distrust among us. I truly am a villager.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, you are deflecting. @Benjamin's claim is logical if he wants to win immediately. Shizue's defense is purely emotional.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I understand the shock, but the divination does not lie. Shizue is the werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm just saying, we shouldn't just believe one person! What if Benjamin is the bad guy?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,The probability of Benjamin being the werewolf and claiming Seer on Day 1 is lower than him actually being the Seer.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Please, let's think about this. I couldn't possibly hurt anyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Emotional appeals are not evidence. I trust Benjamin's logic over Shizue's kindness.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I have provided the fact. The decision now rests with the village.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I still don't like this, but if everyone is against her...","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
